+            <div class="intro-card">
+                <p><strong>Welcome to Movies Now!</strong></p>
+                <p>Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how our app collects, uses, discloses, and safeguards your information. Please read this policy carefully to understand our practices.</p>
